[{"title":"中秋不见月","author":"解缙","text":"吾闻广寒八万三千修月斧，暗处生明缺处补。\n不知七宝何以修合成，孤光洞彻乾坤万万古。\n三秋正中夜当午，嫦娥韬光匿何所。\n酒杯狼籍烛无辉，天上人间隔风雨。\n玉女莫乘鸾，仙人休伐树。\n天柱不可登，虹桥在何处。\n帝阍悠悠叫无路，我欲斩蟾蜍、驱玉兔。\n坐令天宇绝纤尘，世上青霄灿如故。\n黄金为节玉为辂，缥缈鸾车烂无数。\n水晶帘外河汉横，冰壶影里笙歌度。\n云旗尽下飞玄武，青鸟衔书报王母。\n但期岁岁奉宸游，来看《霓裳羽衣》舞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13972,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽筠涧先生","author":"解缙","text":"逐鹿兵还郊鼎移，故家风节似君稀。\n山河百二还真主，泉石东南隐少微。\n黄菊花时高士醉，青门瓜熟故侯归。\n九原若遇余豳国，犹话孤城未解围。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13973,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘御史按交趾","author":"解缙","text":"虬髯白舄绣衣郎，骢马南巡古越裳。\n城郭新开秦郡县，山河原是汉金汤。\n天连铜柱蛮烟黑，地接珠崖海气黄。\n莫说炎荒冰雪少，须令六月见飞霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13974,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苍梧即事 其一","author":"解缙","text":"苍梧城北系龙洲，水接南天日夜流。\n冰井鳄池春草合，火山蛟室夜光浮。\n千家竹屋临沙嘴，万斛江船下石头。\n伏枕梦回霄汉近，佩声犹在凤凰楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13975,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苍梧即事 其二","author":"解缙","text":"梧州旧治扶桑国，虎圈山名记大藩。\n蜑户举罾看水影，舟人移橛认潮痕。\n蘋婆果熟红包拆，荔子花开绿萼繁。\n北望九疑云尽处，重华端拱太微垣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13976,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苍梧即事 其三","author":"解缙","text":"桂岭东来下恶滩，苍梧细柳綵云间。\n拍天二水通交广，耸日高城跨北山。\n茆屋竹牌依古濑，筒槽渔艇满江湾。\n驿亭笳鼓中宵发，又报南天使节还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13977,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"退朝即事 其二","author":"解缙","text":"赤栏红映夕阳齐，蹀躞天骐度不嘶。\n侍讲报来应锁甲，乘舆又过御桥西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13978,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早朝","author":"解缙","text":"骢马五更寒，披衣上绣鞍。\n东华天未晓，明月满阑干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13979,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赴广西别甥彭云路","author":"解缙","text":"多情为我谢彭郎，采石江深似渭阳。\n相聚六年如梦过，不如昨夜一更长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13980,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过全州","author":"解缙","text":"陶生岩畔草青青，唐介坟前江水声。\n两岸鹧鸪啼不尽，画船挝鼓过全城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13981,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨白花","author":"杨士奇","text":"杨白花，逐风起。\n含霜弄雪太轻盈，荡日摇春无定止。\n楼中佳人双翠颦，坐见纷纷渡江水。\n天长水阔花渺茫，一曲悲歌思千里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13982,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"巫山高","author":"杨士奇","text":"巫山高高十二峰，连崖叠巘重复重。\n昔时阳台下神女，翠敛红销空处所。\n朝朝峡里望氛氲，可怜犹似作行云。\n相思已下沾裳泪，况复猿啼不可闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13983,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄尤文度 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"苦忆尤参议，投簪养病劳。\n卑栖人总厌，閒散自能高。\n厨却胡奴米，门深仲蔚蒿。\n平生冰雪意，犹足重吾曹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13984,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻角","author":"杨士奇","text":"风静周庐夕，营门角起愁。\n不须三弄彻，对月泪先流。\n杨柳飘还合，梅花落未休。\n乡心已无限，何必在边州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13985,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得沧浪送陈景祺之襄阳知府","author":"杨士奇","text":"汉水带襄城，沧浪旧有名。\n分符来五马，如练照双旌。\n济涉思为楫，听歌想濯缨。\n须令郡人说，堪比使君清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13986,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送给事中姚山赴河南佥宪","author":"杨士奇","text":"观风在激扬，今喜擢苏章。\n袖有银台笔，衣含玉殿香。\n河流明宪节，嵩岳对公堂。\n想见澄清日，歌声满洛阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13987,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送胡元节广西宪使","author":"杨士奇","text":"骢马赤茸鞦，临岐嘶未休。\n朝廷用儒雅，风纪得才猷。\n天远三湘外，霜含八桂秋。\n贪渔嗟薄俗，表率在名流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13988,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚同宗豫先归诣清河途中寄勉仁弘济","author":"杨士奇","text":"载书先发赴前营，雨浥飞埃晚更晴。\n人喜望家三舍近，马知归路四蹄轻。\n风飘点点溪花送，日射行行野树明。\n却忆今宵毡帐底，翠壶红烛伴双清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13989,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从游西苑","author":"杨士奇","text":"广寒宫殿属天家，晓从宸游驻翠华。\n琼液总颁仙掌露，金支皆插御筵花。\n棹穿萍藻波间雪，旗飐芙蓉水上霞。\n身世真超人境外，玉盘亲捧枣如瓜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13990,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邳州城下夜雨","author":"杨士奇","text":"薄暮风色寒，移舟宿前渚。\n欹枕不成眠，孤篷夜来雨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13991,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜发清江口","author":"杨士奇","text":"日落烟水寒，解缆清江渚。\n中夜北风来，相送潭州去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13992,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夹沟遇邑人问家信","author":"杨士奇","text":"闻道故乡来，辞家今远近。\n恐有南京书，停舟试相问。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13993,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南行 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"家住横塘口，船开去渐遥。\n归时不愁暮，出浦正乘潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13994,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南行 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"偶来长浦里，相伴采莲归。\n并船打两桨，溅水湿罗衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13995,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意答伯阳","author":"杨士奇","text":"河洲双鸳鸯，流荡还相逐。\n皎皎白杨花，风吹不相续。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13996,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发淮安","author":"杨士奇","text":"岸蓼疏红水荇青，茨菰花白小如萍。\n双鬟短袖惭人见，背立船头自采菱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13997,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扈从巡边至宣府往还杂诗 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"北斗初高月未斜，五更清露净尘沙。\n道边丛绕炉香立，多是耆人候翠华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13998,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扈从巡边至宣府往还杂诗 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"居庸关中四十里，回冈复岭度萦纡。\n道傍石刻无人识，尽是前朝蒙古书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13999,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扈从巡边至宣府往还杂诗 其六","author":"杨士奇","text":"红叶离离净可书，绿渠流水见游鱼。\n老臣虚拜貂裘赐，一路阳和护属车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14000,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扈从巡边至宣府往还杂诗 其八","author":"杨士奇","text":"山望鸡鸣势入云，下循仄径棘纷纷。\n不辞涉险观遗碣，重是欧阳太史文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14001,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扈从巡边至宣府往还杂诗 其九","author":"杨士奇","text":"关外初冬似早春，僧房犹见菊花新。\n时平扈从巡边塞，宣府回銮只二旬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14002,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扈从巡边至宣府往还杂诗 其十","author":"杨士奇","text":"怀来城外夜微雪，风送轻寒初著身。\n明旦马前红一色，回军共试赐衣新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14003,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"以绢问张子俊求画","author":"杨士奇","text":"梦忆衡庐紫翠重，结巢须倚玉芙蓉。\n天恩未便教投绂，一幅鹅溪更恼公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14004,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入蓟州界","author":"杨士奇","text":"云净天清紫翠浮，好山消尽越乡愁。\n行人如有江南兴，马上题诗入蓟州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14005,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宣德丙午谒二陵 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"去年侍从谒长陵，此日重来恸倍增。\n春柳春花浑似昔，献陵陵树复层层。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14006,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宣德丙午谒二陵 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"君恩追忆不胜哀，老泪乾枯病骨摧。\n陵下一来肠一断，馀生知复几回来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14007,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明有感","author":"杨士奇","text":"西江南望渺天涯，岁岁清明不在家。\n荡日飘风无定著，乱人情思是杨花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14008,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题少保杨澹庵江乡归趣图 其七","author":"杨士奇","text":"巴陵西畔楚江分，曾泛湖波望岳云。\n借得君山小龙笛，月明吹向洞庭君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14009,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上早行","author":"杨士奇","text":"汉阳楼上鼓初稀，烟柳昽昽一鹊飞。\n乘月不知行处远，满江风露湿人衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14010,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三十六湾","author":"杨士奇","text":"湘阴县南江水斜，春来两岸无人家。\n深林日午鸟啼歇，开遍满山红白花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14011,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题鄂渚赠别图送人归庐陵 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"鹦鹉江中红树，凤凰城里青山。\n借问来游几日，秋水兰舟独还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14012,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题鄂渚赠别图送人归庐陵 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"客游黄鹤矶畔，家住金鱼浦前。\n心似波间明月，随君先过螺川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14013,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕赐观灯诗 其一","author":"杨荣","text":"海宇升平日，元宵令节时。\n綵云飘凤阙，瑞霭绕龙旗。\n歌管春声动，星河夜色迟。\n万方同乐事，千载际昌期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14014,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕赐观灯诗 其三","author":"杨荣","text":"禁苑东风暖，青霄月正中。\n鱼龙千队戏，罗绮万花丛。\n云峤祥光丽，星桥宝炬红。\n太平多乐事，此夕万方同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14015,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕赐观灯诗 其五","author":"杨荣","text":"象纬临天阙，瑶空集万灵。\n云霞纷掩映，星斗叠晶荧。\n宝地春应满，金门夜不扃。\n千官陪宴乐，拜舞在明庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14016,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"围猎","author":"杨荣","text":"关塞霜清晓色明，銮舆校猎出边城。\n六龙扶辇旌旗合，万骑连营鼓角鸣。\n远火依微秋草薄，惊沙寂历暮云平。\n小臣躬睹三驱乐，?效嵩呼播颂声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14017,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"京师八景 其四 琼岛春云","author":"杨荣","text":"仙岛依微近紫清，春风淡荡暖云生。\n乍经树杪和烟湿，轻覆花枝过雨晴。\n每日氤氲浮玉殿，常时缥缈护金茎。\n从龙处处施甘泽，四海讴歌乐治平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14018,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"京师八景 其五 蓟门烟树","author":"杨荣","text":"蓟门春雨散浮埃，烟树溟濛霁欲开。\n十里清阴连紫陌，半空翠影接金台。\n东风叶暗留莺语，落日林深过鸟回。\n记得清明携酒处，碧桃花底坐徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14019,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宣德丙午扈驾巡边途中感兴 其一","author":"杨溥","text":"膏车度重关，重关路漫漫。\n两厢既充轫，四牡何盘桓。\n翘首望前{車丸}，迢迢不可攀。\n任重难为力，临歧发长叹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14020,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宣德丙午扈驾巡边途中感兴 其二","author":"杨溥","text":"策马登崇冈，一览洞八荒。\n山川限南北，华夷有定疆。\n猗欤商周盛，以德为保障。\n秦隋勤远略，祸乱起萧墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14021,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东征","author":"杨溥","text":"搀抢耀齐分，龙御勤六师。\n出门驰马去，不暇告妻儿。\n亲友送我行，欲语难为辞。\n死生岂不恤，国事身以之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14022,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日扈从幸北京","author":"胡广","text":"晓随仙仗出时巡，圣主恩深四海春。\n万马踏云开辇路，六龙扶日度天津。\n阳和布泽初回暖，别苑飞花不动尘。\n岂是扬雄能献赋，空惭载笔列词臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14023,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送江仲隆","author":"胡广","text":"十年清宦住京畿，白发萧萧老布衣。\n乡里交游前辈在，关河离别故人稀。\n官桥细柳藏新雨，水驿轻帆背夕晖。\n我有愁怀何处遣，秋来日望雁南飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14024,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日早朝","author":"胡广","text":"秋满都门一雁飞，轻罗初拟试朝衣。\n城头鼓角催更尽，阙下星河向晓稀。\n佳气入云浮紫殿，新凉先雨到彤墀。\n涵濡共际雍熙日，谁识阳和造化机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14025,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日随驾北征次清河（永乐八年）","author":"金幼孜","text":"万乘统元戎，鸣銮出九重。\n暖尘生辇路，晴雪照行宫。\n旗影西山外，笳声落照中。\n书生怀脱略，须敌万夫雄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14026,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早发清河","author":"金幼孜","text":"海色正苍凉，龙旗拂曙光。\n雕戈寒映日，羽箭薄凝霜。\n城阙云中近，关山笛里长。\n天兵随杀气，万里扫搀抢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14027,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次怀来","author":"金幼孜","text":"羽檄通宵急，行宫出每迟。\n漏声催鼓角，月影上旌旗。\n风逐天香近，星随斗柄移。\n中军严宿卫，传警尽熊罴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14028,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次万全","author":"金幼孜","text":"画戟雕戈映晚天，辕门尽日鼓喧阗。\n御前视草冰生砚，帐下题诗雪满毡。\n楼堞平空开朔漠，关门斗绝锁胡烟。\n六军坐睹旄头落，何待阴山羽檄传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14029,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早发兴和","author":"金幼孜","text":"未晓戒严程，鸣弓度塞城。\n川云随地起，野火杂星明。\n虎旅听笳动，銮旗傍跸行。\n草清沙路软，浑觉马蹄轻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14030,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"誓师毕随驾回营中马上赋","author":"金幼孜","text":"万里阴山道，平原入望赊。\n天营高日月，辇路净风沙。\n宝马衔金勒，苍龙绕翠华。\n阳和随处满，草色遍天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14031,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次归化甸","author":"金幼孜","text":"御前传檄罢，歇马卸鞍鞯。\n日落双旌晚，云开万幕连。\n边声回朔吹，尘色蔽胡天。\n敌忾心犹切，长歌北伐篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14032,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早发禽胡山","author":"金幼孜","text":"六师严号令，车骑肃前征。\n塞月云中暗，胡尘雨后清。\n沙鸡随箭落，野马近人惊。\n咫尺闻天语，常依御辇行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14033,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次永安甸（即三汊口）","author":"金幼孜","text":"大幕尘清虏气摧，六师奏凯六龙回。\n妖氛扫地旄头灭，御气浮空雉尾来。\n武帐平临天汉回，戍楼遥傍朔云开。\n行人笑指京华近，北望红云拥上台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14034,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉和学士胡公春日陪驾同游万岁山 其一","author":"金幼孜","text":"凤辇游仙岛，春残花尚浓。\n龙纹蟠玉砌，莺语度瑶宫。\n香雾浮高树，祥云丽碧空。\n五城双阙外，宛在画图中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14035,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉和学士胡公春日陪驾同游万岁山 其八","author":"金幼孜","text":"暖露滋瑶草，轻飙动碧篁。\n龙蟠知岁月，鹤唳识风霜。\n凿谷通仙径，穿岩辟洞房。\n回看城阙近，禁树晚苍苍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14036,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕午门赐观灯 其二","author":"金幼孜","text":"五夜开阊阖，千官引佩珂。\n御烟浮宝篆，华月送清歌。\n岁久君恩重，时平乐事多。\n金吾知不禁，试问夜如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14037,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕午门赐观灯 其三","author":"金幼孜","text":"鳌山新结綵，列炬照晴天。\n箫鼓瑶台上，星河绛阙前。\n綵妆千队好，绣簇万花妍。\n欢赏陪鸾驭，还歌《既醉》篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14038,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日喜雨写怀 其一","author":"金幼孜","text":"粉署依丹禁，城虚爽气多。\n好风天上至，凉雨晓来过。\n翠岛浮香雾，瑶池澹绿波。\n九重閒视草，时复幸銮坡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14039,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日喜雨写怀 其二","author":"金幼孜","text":"夏过日初长，连朝雨送凉。\n捲帘书帖静，开户燕泥香。\n赐果来东阁，分冰近御床。\n小臣叨侍从，屡得被恩光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14040,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日喜雨写怀 其三","author":"金幼孜","text":"玉堂清切地，潇洒出氛埃。\n雨点疏疏过，天香冉冉来。\n隔花莺历乱，近水燕飞回。\n朝退有馀暇，新诗取次裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14041,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]